  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, whisk together lime juice, soy sauce, and oil.",
    "2. Add the chicken pieces to the marinade and mix well.",
    "3. Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "4. Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "5. Thread the chicken onto skewers.",
    "6. Grill the chicken for 5-7 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "7. Brush with kissed oil and serve with satay sauce."
